Package: libsdl2-2.0-0
Version: @DEB_SDL2_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.libsdl.org/
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, angle, libpulse0
Description: SDL2 runtime for Xios Wayland games
 SDL2 built as a native iOS/Darwin library with the Wayland video backend,
 OpenGL ES through Xios ANGLE, touch and desktop input through iosc, and
 PulseAudio output. Cocoa and UIKit window backends are intentionally disabled.
